BRAND ASSETS CARVE-OUT

The MIT license above covers the CSS tokens, font-face declarations,
JSX/HTML UI kit source, slide HTML templates, and the text of this
documentation.

It does NOT cover brand assets in the `assets/` directory, which include:
- The GRC Engineering Club logo and wordmark
- The orange brand mark
- Leadership headshots
- Merch product photography
- Any derivative of the above

These assets are the property of the individuals depicted and the GRC
Engineering Club. They are provided in this repository for reference and
internal use by contributors working on official Club properties. Reuse
outside of Club-sanctioned work requires written permission.
